# Coach speech (Traditional Chinese, Taiwan / Hong Kong): the review of the player's moves
# (src/coach/review.cpp, review_explain.cpp). Same keys and variants as
# assets/coach/speech/en/review.lang. Subtitle text only (the voice speaks the English line), so no
# ".spoken" overrides here.
#
# Placeholders: {your} / {your2} = a piece of the player ("你的車"), {my} / {my2} = a piece of the
# coach ("我的馬"), {t1} / {t2} = a piece of EITHER side, with its possessive; never write 你的 / 我的
# in front of them. {sq} = a square ("e4"); {move} the player's move, {best} a better move, {reply}
# the coach's answer (figurine notation, "♘f3"); {line} a few moves; {eval} "+1.3" or "3步將死";
# {text} = a mate pattern name (name.pattern.*), said after "叫作" or a colon.
# Counted numbers use common.lang's count.<noun>: {m:move} "3步", {pts:point} "3分", {n:piece}
# "3個子", {n:square} "3格". A square is never followed directly by a digit ("e4 3次"): a number
# next to a square is a counted phrase on the other side of a word.
# Terms (glossary): 將軍, 將死, 逼和, 捉雙 (levels 2+; level 1 says 雙重攻擊), 牽制, 串擊, 閃擊, 雙將,
# 漏著, 錯著, 不精確, 最佳著法, 唯一著法, 底線, 逃生格 / 氣孔 (luft, levels 4+), 對王 (opposition),
# 通路兵 (passed pawn), 正方形法則 (the square of the pawn), 雙象, 兌子, 棄子, 得子 (to win
# material), 白吃 (to take for free), 出子, 先手 (tempo), 悔棋. Two 的 are never stacked
# ("{sq}的{my}" -> "{my}在{sq}"). {your:bare} / {my:bare} = the piece without 你的 / 我的, where the
# sentence already names its owner ("你會把{your:bare}走到{sq}" -> "你會把車走到c6").

# ---- Announcements (either side's move) -------------------------------------------------------
# The player gives check (levels 1-2: say what it means).
ann.check.human.b1 = 將軍！我的王被攻擊了。
ann.check.human.b1.2 = 將軍！你在攻擊我的王。
ann.check.human.b1.3 = 這就是將軍！我必須解除將軍。
ann.check.human = 將軍。
ann.check.human.2 = 將軍！
ann.check.human.3 = 這步將軍了。
# The coach gives check.
ann.check.coach = 將軍！
ann.check.coach.2 = 將軍。
ann.check.coach.3 = 將你一軍！
# Once per game at levels 1-2, right after the coach's first check ({your} = the king).
ann.check.coach.first = 這表示{your}受到攻擊。你必須解除將軍。
ann.check.coach.first.2 = 將軍就是{your}被攻擊。移開它、擋住攻擊，或吃掉我的子。
ann.double_check.coach = 雙將！我有兩個子同時攻擊你的王，所以它必須移動。
ann.double_check.coach.2 = 這是雙將：現在你只能移動王。
ann.double_check.human = 雙將！你有兩個子同時攻擊我的王，所以它必須移動。
ann.double_check.human.2 = 這下是雙將！只有移動王才能救我了。
# The player checkmates the coach.
ann.mate.human.b1 = 將死！你贏了！我的王逃不掉了。
ann.mate.human.b1.2 = 這是將死！做得好，你贏了這盤棋！
ann.mate.human.b1.3 = 將死！我的王被困住了。恭喜你！
ann.mate.human = 將死。下得好。
ann.mate.human.2 = 將死了。恭喜你。
ann.mate.human.3 = 將死！漂亮。
# The coach checkmates the player.
ann.mate.coach.b1 = 將死了。你的王無路可逃。
ann.mate.coach.b1.2 = 將死。你的王被攻擊，而且逃不掉。
ann.mate.coach.b1.3 = 恐怕這是將死了。你的王跑不掉。
ann.mate.coach = 將死。
ann.mate.coach.2 = 這樣就將死了。
ann.mate.coach.3 = 恐怕是將死了。

